        "official_en_sha256": "536f45e1bf6fe3a497e6b14f1be23d81bafb74354b105888d112ff616fd71ec0"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "俺たちは生活するのも苦しいってのに\r\n軍には国の金が際限なくつぎ込まれている。",
        "official_en": "Us common folk are barely scraping by, while the military gets all the gil they need.",
        "real_en": "We're barely getting by, yet the government keeps pouring endless funds into the military."
      },
