      "text": {
        "jp": "全部、ソゼ皇帝のせいだ。\r\nきっとどこかの国と戦争する気なんだろう……。",
        "official_en": "Emperor Sozhe’s to blame for it all. I reckon he wants to go to war with some other country.",
